{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14108202","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14108202","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410820101:":{"text":"쫓아가라!","source_cn":"追！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C08ADD1DB1ED7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410820102:":{"text":"괜찮습니다. 가게 두시지요.","source_cn":"没事，别管他们了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x593FC77275D383D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410820201:0":{"text":"퀸, 저들을 놓쳐서는 안 됩니다.","source_cn":"奎茵，不能放走他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B2E7DC247A85418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410820202:1":{"text":"튜더, 당신이 걱정하는 것은 이해합니다.","source_cn":"我理解您的担忧，都铎大人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA321B6199AC11A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410820203:1":{"text":"인듀어는 은혜의 이슬을 거부했지요. 은총이 없으니 곧 죄악화될 것입니다.","source_cn":"因度厄已经拒绝了灵露。没有恩典的滋养，他很快就会孽化。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x726C086527DACE17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410820204:1":{"text":"그때가 되면 인듀어의 동료들이 직접 그의 숨통을 끊든지, 아니면 괴물로 변하는 모습을 지켜만 봐야할 것입니다.","source_cn":"到那时候，他的同伴要么亲手了结他，要么看着他变成怪物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D535CF8BB847637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410820205:1":{"text":"저희가 직접 죽이는 것보다는 낫지 않습니까?","source_cn":"这比杀了他更好，不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x411B0814BFE71ACC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410820206:1":{"text":"만약...","source_cn":"万一……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12B36E28CB55D895","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410820207:1":{"text":"만약 인듀어가 마음을 바꾸어 은혜의 이슬을 마신다면... 더 좋고요.","source_cn":"万一他回心转意，喝下恩典灵露……那就更好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B53F536C352977C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410820208:1":{"text":"분명 여왕님의 깊은 뜻을 이해하게 될 겁니다.","source_cn":"他就会明白女王大人的良苦用心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259E12AEA3C1C543","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410820209:1":{"text":"하지만...","source_cn":"但是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF42FF06FD148D39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410820210:1":{"text":"전부 여왕님의 뜻입니다.","source_cn":"这是陛下的意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8FAB954BCFEB207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410820211:0":{"text":"알겠습니다. 모두 추격을 멈춰라!","source_cn":"我明白了。众士兵听令，停止追击——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66F3092E83D606C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1410820212:0":{"text":"그와 동시에 나와 조아, 인듀어는 헥토르의 신전으로 텔레포트를 성공했다...","source_cn":"与此同时，你、祖娅和因度厄也成功传送到赫托神殿……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65CCCACC177FDE85","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그와 동시에 나와 조아, 인듀어는 헥토르의 신전으로 텔레포트를 성공했다...","female":"그와 동시에 나와 조아, 인듀어는 헥토르의 신전으로 텔레포트를 성공했다...","variant_male_record_index":"158780","variant_female_record_index":"158781","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:140108119:0":{"text":"긴급 전송으로 서둘러 왕성을 떠나는 우리를 튜더가 추격하려고 했지만, 퀸이 막아섰다.","source_cn":"你们紧急传送离开了宫殿，都铎试图继续追击时，被奎茵拦了下来。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0BBE84EA3AADA3CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"긴급 전송으로 서둘러 왕성을 떠나는 우리를 튜더가 추격하려고 했지만, 퀸이 막아섰다.","female":"긴급 전송으로 서둘러 왕성을 떠나는 우리를 튜더가 추격하려고 했지만, 퀸이 막아섰다.","variant_male_record_index":"166571","variant_female_record_index":"166572","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":